    <string name="btn_grant_usage_access">Open System Settings</string>
    <string name="usage_access_desc">Android requires explicit Usage Access permission to measure screen time across installed apps accurately without invasive VPNs or root privileges.\n\nHow to enable:\n1. Tap \'Open System Settings\' below.\n2. Locate \'KidsGuard Child\' in the list.\n3. Turn ON \'Permit usage access\'.\n\nPrivacy Guarantee:\n• KidsGuard only measures foreground app durations.\n• No keystrokes, personal chats, photos, or browsing URLs are accessed or transmitted.\n• No background audio, camera, or covert monitoring.</string>

